 da: angular width (degrees), \n#      v: median velocity (km/s)\n#     dv: variation (1 sigma) of velocity over the width of the CME\n#   minv: lowest velocity detected within the CME\n#   maxv: highest velocity detected within the CME\n#  halo?: II if da>90, III if da>180, IV if da>270, indicating potential halo/partial halo CME\n# \n  </PRE>\n <td valign='top'>\n  <PRE>\n# CME |          t0    | dt0| pa | da |  v  |  dv | minv| maxv| halo?\n  <a href=\"CME0029/CME.html\" target=\"_blank\" >0029</a>|2026/09/11 21:48| 01 | 327| 012| 0421| 0020| 0379| 0422|    \n  <a href=\"CME0028/CME.html\" target=\"_blank\" >0028</a>|2026/09/11 13:36| 01 | 314| 034| 0303| 0086| 0171| 0480|    \n  <a href=\"CME0027/CME.html\" target=\"_blank\" >0027</a>|2026/09/11 06:24| 02 | 337| 020| 0419| 0075| 0347| 0589|    \n  <a href=\"CME0026/CME.html\" target=\"_blank\" >0026</a>|2026/09/10 21:12| 01 | 044| 006| 0821| 0213| 0466| 0976|    \n  <a href=\"CME0025/CME.html\" target=\"_blank\" >0025</a>|2026/09/10 21:12| 00 | 007| 012| 0380| 0036| 0315| 0431|    \n  <a href=\"CME0024/CME.html\" target=\"_blank\" >0024</a>|2026/09/10 20:00| 04 | 331| 152| 040"
